  "_notice": "FICTITIOUS. Plans, pharmacy benefit processors and formulary positions for a product that does not exist. Every plan, processor, BIN, PCN and formulary is invented; BINs use the 000 prefix. Medicaid, Medicare and TRICARE are real public programs kept by the fiction, but every coverage detail here is invented.",
