  "usage": "Formulary position of QUORVANTA on each plan named in test-design/ps-cases.json. prior_authorization is none, new_starts (only for patients starting QUORVANTA, whose first fill is a starter bottle) or all. A case whose plan requires prior authorization and whose pa.status is PA_NOT_REQUIRED has a current authorization on file in payer/transactions.json. required_pharmacy matches the case's insurance.required_pharmacy. Reject codes are the pack's own; they correspond to, but do not reproduce, the codes in the industry telecommunication standard. There is no price for QUORVANTA in this pack, so claims carry patient amounts only. payer/formulary-fhir.json is generated from this file by scripts/render.py.",
